    "en": "A random variable X has p(x) = kx for x = 1, 2, 3, 4. Find k, P(X ≥ 3) and F(2)."
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "Σp(x) = k(1 + 2 + 3 + 4) = 10k = 1 ⇒ k = 1/10."
