    {
     "en": "P(X ≥ 3) = p(3) + p(4) = 3/10 + 4/10 = 7/10."
    },
    {
     "en": "F(2) = P(X ≤ 2) = 1/10 + 2/10 = 3/10."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "k = 1/10, P(X ≥ 3) = 0.7, F(2) = 0.3"
